msgctxt "76\t155"
msgid "We will be arriving in approximately 10 minutes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156\t286"
msgid ""
"Please remain seated with your seatbelt\\nfastened until we have safely "
"landed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364\t558"
msgid ""
"Man. I'd give anything to see\\nthe look on Kiryu's face right about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "559\t703"
msgid "Bet he realizes he should never\\nhave messed with the Hakuho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "734\t899"
msgid ""
"We've waited so long...\\nbut it's finally Chairman Mine's time to shine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900\t1038"
msgid ""
"I think we've earned ourselves\\na little party once we're back in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1043\t1091"
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "E per cosa?"

msgctxt "1092\t1245"
msgid "Mine's a lock for the seventh\\nchairmanship at this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1247\t1441"
msgid ""
"Not only is our Kiryu problem snuffed out for good,\\nbut we're gonna be top"
" of the pack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464\t1516"
msgid "Guess you're right."
msgstr "Immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "1532\t1590"
msgid "The boss'll be happy, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1591\t1708"
msgid "But you know, the sixth chairman\\nlet his guard down way too easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1744\t1848"
msgid "No wonder he got a bullet in his chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1852\t2042"
msgid ""
"Got that right. Kid like him had no business\\nleading the clan in the first"
" place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2047\t2170"
msgid "Not too long since he was in diapers, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2208\t2301"
msgid "But I guess he's good as dead now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2302\t2363"
msgid "Hell yeah he is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2406\t2447"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "2448\t2606"
msgid "Oh, Chairman. He was just suggesting\\nwe throw ourselves a party."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2620\t2692"
msgid "Why, did something good happen?"
msgstr "Ti è successo qualcosa di bello?"

msgctxt "2693\t2766"
msgid "Oh yeah, it's⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2816\t2895"
msgid "What happened, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2932\t3051"
msgid "You think the sixth chairman's death\\nis something to celebrate!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3112\t3200"
msgid "Is it!?"
msgstr ""
